window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>This omnibus collection 2 includes Books 4 through 6 of Dashing Devil. It chronicles the explosive arc of Boyd’s evolution from reluctant protector to heroic icon. Packed with sharp banter, emotional revelations, searing romance, and relentless action, this edition includes seven bonus chapters exclusive to the collection.</p> <p>Boyd's legend is no longer whispered about—it’s broadcast far and wide. The Hero who killed Omega Ray battles dragons in the Wild Lands and reshapes what it means be a champion to the downtrodden. In books four through six of the Dashing Devil series, Boyd and his Devoted charge into the spotlight.</p> <p>But with power and recognition come scrutiny, envy, and enemies who hide behind tailored suits and smiling masks. Fame might open doors for The Devoted, but it also paints a massive target on their backs. And it isn’t much of a surprise that those aiming for the target are supposed Heroes, themselves.</p> <p>Now an icon, Boyd juggles his role as leader, lover, and protector of a team that refuses to fit into The Authority’s mold. While his Devoted help him navigate fan riots, death matches, and dubious sponsorships, shadowy forces gather—some eager to manipulate Boyd’s fate, others bent on ending his rise before it destabilizes the status quo.</p> <p>But Boyd is not the same demon his Mentors tried to silence as a teen.</p> <p>Legacy, loyalty, and lethal ambition collide as Dashing Devil steps boldly in a world that finally knows his name—knows it… and fears it.</p>"; 
